    "body": "fix on issue/2713-feature-edge-join-cross-holes · PR #2728 · pinned by feature_edge_g1_join::no_pickable_edge_is_a_tangent_piece_of_a_longer_one_in_any_step_fixture, tilted_gouge::the_step_bars_wall_facet_normals_follow_the_cylinder · merges when reviewed\n\nThe test was red on a clean `upstream/main` 75e74a9cb, not only on the merged branch. The cause is the STEP importer, not the join law: the split of #2600 left flat cap facets on the bar's wall, and the feature graph read their edges as creases. The PR body has the readings.\n",
