    "body": "Post-merge run 44467253420 at `75e74a9cb` is red. Two steps failed.\n\n- `app suites: feature_edge_g1_join` - test `no_pickable_edge_is_a_tangent_piece_of_a_longer_one_in_any_step_fixture`. This is the failure this issue names.\n- `kernel suites: step_agreement` - test `step_files_agree_or_refuse_by_name`. No issue tracks this one yet.\n\nBoth tests read the STEP files in `testdata/models/`. The cause is probably the same new fixture. Whoever works this issue should run both tests on clean `main` first. The next push to `main` started run 44479099074 at `163bab9b0`; that run's result is the current truth for `main`.\n",
