    "body": "Sarge's post-merge gate on 75e74a9cb (run 44467253420) shows a SECOND red test, most likely the same cause: `kernel suites: step_agreement` - `step_files_agree_or_refuse_by_name` (7 s). That suite also walks the STEP fixtures, so the new `bar_cross_holes.step` / the refined facets of #2664 are the likely trigger. Both must be green before this closes: `cargo test -p camcraft-app --test feature_edge_g1_join` and `cargo test -p camcraft-kernel --test step_agreement` (kernel runs in quick only when kernel is touched, so run it explicitly). Gate summary: 905 steps, 2 failed, 53.9 min.",
